.Dd May 26, 2026
.Dt OBGUI 1 URM
.Os "Open Babel" 3.2
.Sh "نام (NAME)"
.Nm obgui
.Nd "Open Babel graphical user interface"
.Sh "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.Nm
.Sh "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
There are no command line options.
.Sh "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.Nm
is the Open Babel graphical user interface, an alternative to using the
command line with the same capabilities.
.Sh "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.Xr obabel 1 .
.Pp
The web pages for Open Babel can be found at:
\%<\fBhttps://openbabel.org/\fR>
.Sh "نویسندگان (AUTHORS)"
.An -nosplit
Open Babel is developed by a cast of many, including current maintainers
.An Geoff Hutchison ,
.An Chris Morley ,
.An Michael Banck ,
and innumerable others who have contributed fixes and additions.
For more contributors to Open Babel, see
\%<\fBhttps://openbabel.org/docs/Introduction/thanks.html\fR>
